{
  "info": {
    "name": "ipp_agentic_api",
    "description": "# ipp_agentic_api + MAF\n\nUse environment **IPP local** (`baseUrl` http://127.0.0.1:8000, `mafUrl` :8003) or **IPP Azure**.\n\n## Swagger (same API)\n\nOpen `{{baseUrl}}/docs` after starting ipp_agentic_api (`ip_api`). Schema: `{{baseUrl}}/openapi.json`. Title in Swagger is **ipp_agentic_api**.\n\n## Typical order\n\n1. Gateway \u2192 Health\n2. Documents \u2192 Create job (attach a `.docx` from `samples/templates/`) \u2192 Get job (wait) \u2192 Download\n3. Voice \u2192 Start contract \u2192 Confirm (uses saved `thread_id`)\n4. Admin needs `adminKey` in the environment (`ADMIN_API_KEY`)\n\nDocument/voice MCP `:8001/mcp` and `:8002/mcp` are **not** REST. Use gateway or MAF \u2192 Invoke.\n\nDo **not** put API keys or SQL passwords in this collection.\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "xid",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "sessionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "job_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "thread_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "contract_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "transcription_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "templateName",
      "value": "complete_contract_template_GPO.docx"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Gateway",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "OpenAPI (Swagger schema)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Machine-readable schema used by `/docs`. Import into tools that speak OpenAPI.",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/openapi.json"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
            "description": "Liveness plus LLM/MAF/MCP flags. HTTP 200 even when `status` is `degraded`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ask (chat via MAF)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Prompt\": \"how many contracts going to expire in the next quarter\",\n  \"Persona\": \"sales\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ask",
            "description": "Prompt + Persona definition. Validator confidence must meet MAF_PERSONA_VALIDATOR_MIN_CONFIDENCE (default 0.95)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ask health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ask/health",
            "description": "Whether the gateway can reach MAF `/ask/health`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List catalog prompts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/ask/prompts",
            "description": "Prompt ids and allowed_roles from MAF catalog files."
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Health and chat (`POST /api/ask` \u2192 MAF). Start here."
    },
    {
      "name": "Documents",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create job (template + JSON data)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.job_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('job_id', j.job_id);",
                  "  if (j.xid) pm.collectionVariables.set('xid', j.xid);",
                  "  if (j.session_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('sessionId', j.session_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "template",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Select samples/templates/*.docx"
                },
                {
                  "key": "data",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "{\"party\":\"AVC\"}",
                  "description": "JSON object as a form string, not a file"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs",
            "description": "multipart: `template` file + `data` JSON string. 202 + `job_id`. Attach `samples/templates/*.docx`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List jobs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs?limit=20",
            "description": "Newest document jobs first.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get job (wait)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs/{{job_id}}?wait=true&timeout=180",
            "description": "Long-poll until completed/failed (`wait=true`). Uses collection `job_id`.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Job accuracy",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs/{{job_id}}/accuracy",
            "description": "Judge/mapper scores for `job_id`. 404 if missing.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Download accuracy PDF",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs/{{job_id}}/accuracy.pdf",
            "description": "PDF of the same accuracy report. 404 if missing.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Download job docx",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs/{{job_id}}/download",
            "description": "Binary Word file. 409 if job not completed.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Trace by xid",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/traces/{{xid}}",
            "description": "Logs for correlation id saved from Create job (`xid`).",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete job",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "description": "Removes job row. 204 empty body.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents/jobs/{{job_id}}"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Multipart job API. Create returns `job_id` (saved). Then wait + download. `data` is a JSON **string**, not a file."
    },
    {
      "name": "Audio (STT only)",
      "description": "Whisper transcription. Does not create a contract.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Transcribe",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "Upload audio \u2192 text. Needs OPENAI_API_KEY or GROQ_API_KEY.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "audio",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "language",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "en",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audio/transcribe"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get transcription",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Saved row from Transcribe (`transcription_id`).",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/audio/transcriptions/{{transcription_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Voice",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Start contract (text)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.thread_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('thread_id', j.thread_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"transcript\": \"please create contract with legal entity AVC contract reference number CR 1001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/contract",
            "description": "JSON transcript. Saves `thread_id` on 200."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Confirm contract",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (j.contract_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('contract_id', j.contract_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"legal_entity\": \"AVC\",\n  \"contract_reference_number\": \"CR-1001\",\n  \"thread_id\": \"{{thread_id}}\",\n  \"user_text\": \"yes\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/contract/confirm",
            "description": "HITL resume. Fill `thread_id` from Start (auto-saved)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List contracts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/contracts?limit=20",
            "description": "Voice MCP list via gateway.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get contract",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/contracts/{{contract_id}}",
            "description": "Metadata for collection `contract_id`.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Download contract docx",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/contracts/{{contract_id}}/download?format=docx",
            "description": "Query `format=docx` or `txt`. File is on voice MCP disk.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Start contract from audio",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "multipart `audio` then same HITL as Start contract. Confirm still required unless auto_create.",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "audio",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "mp3/wav/m4a/webm"
                },
                {
                  "key": "auto_create",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "false"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/voice/contract/from-audio"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "HITL contract via MAF \u2192 voice MCP. Start saves `thread_id`; confirm uses it."
    },
    {
      "name": "Agents via MAF",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Agents health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/health",
            "description": "MAF catalogue ping.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "All tools",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/tools",
            "description": "Tools from every MCP registered on MAF.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Document tools",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Document MCP tool list via MAF.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/document/tools"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Voice tools",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Voice MCP tool list via MAF.",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/voice/tools"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Document generate (paths, not upload)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"template_path\": \"samples/templates/complete_contract_template_GPO.docx\",\n  \"data_path\": \"samples/data/gpo_agreement.json\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/document/generate",
            "description": "Paths must exist on the document MCP process. Not multipart."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Voice start (agent proxy)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"transcript\": \"please create contract with legal entity AVC contract reference number CR 1001\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/voice/contract",
            "description": "Raw MCP start; prefer Voice \u2192 Start contract."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Voice confirm (agent proxy)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Request-ID",
                "value": "{{xid}}",
                "disabled": true,
                "description": "Optional correlation id"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"legal_entity\": \"AVC\",\n  \"contract_reference_number\": \"CR-1001\",\n  \"thread_id\": \"{{thread_id}}\",\n  \"user_text\": \"yes\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agents/voice/contract/confirm",
            "description": "Raw MCP confirm."
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Same work as documents/voice but JSON **paths on the MCP host**, not file upload. Prefer Documents/Voice folders for operators."
    },
    {
      "name": "MAF direct",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Liveness plus LLM/MAF/MCP flags. HTTP 200 even when `status` is `degraded`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ask health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/ask/health",
            "description": "Whether the gateway can reach MAF `/ask/health`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "MCPs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/mcps",
            "description": "Registered MCP servers on MAF."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Tools",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/tools",
            "description": "MAF tool catalogue."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Invoke document generate",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"server\": \"document\",\n  \"tool\": \"generate_document\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"template_path\": \"samples/templates/complete_contract_template_GPO.docx\",\n    \"data_path\": \"samples/data/gpo_agreement.json\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/invoke",
            "description": "MAF `POST /invoke` document `generate_document`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Invoke voice start",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  const r = j.result || j;",
                  "  if (r.thread_id) pm.collectionVariables.set('thread_id', r.thread_id);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"server\": \"voice\",\n  \"tool\": \"start_voice_contract\",\n  \"arguments\": {\n    \"transcript\": \"please create contract with legal entity AVC contract reference number CR 1001\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/invoke",
            "description": "MAF invoke `start_voice_contract`; saves `thread_id` from `result`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Ask",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"Prompt\": \"how many contracts going to expire in the next quarter\",\n  \"Persona\": \"sales\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{mafUrl}}/ask",
            "description": "MAF chat without gateway. Body is Prompt + Persona definition; confidence floor is config."
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Hit `:8003` without the gateway. `POST /invoke` is jobs; `POST /ask` is chat."
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin templates",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List templates",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Api-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/templates",
            "description": "Admin library. Set `adminKey`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "List folders",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Api-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/templates/folders",
            "description": "Folder names in the template library."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload template",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "description": "multipart `file` .docx into default folder `ipp_default_template`.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Api-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Word .docx"
                },
                {
                  "key": "folder_name",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "ipp_default_template"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/templates"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Download template",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "description": "Bytes for folder/name. Set templateName if you change the default.",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Api-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/templates/ipp_default_template/{{templateName}}/download"
          }
        }
      ],
      "description": "Requires header `X-Admin-Api-Key` = env `adminKey`. 503 if `ADMIN_API_KEY` is unset on the server."
    },
    {
      "name": "Admin master data",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List master data",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Api-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/master-data",
            "description": "Legal/sales notice blocks. Set `adminKey`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add legal notice block",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-Admin-Api-Key",
                "value": "{{adminKey}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"placeholder_key\": \"Legal_Department_Master_Data\",\n  \"category\": \"legal\",\n  \"content\": \"Legal Department\\n200 Connell Drive, Suite 1000\\nBerkeley Heights, NJ 07922\\nE-mail: pmo@ABCTec.com\",\n  \"active\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/master-data",
            "description": "Insert or replace the legal notice block used by document MCP."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Add sales excellence block",
          "request": {
